{"data":{"body":"**[P3] Reject a null config when registering the factory.** The config-only OTel factory overloads now accept a typed null and defer its dereference until invocation startup. `PluginRunner` then contains the resulting factory failure, so the function continues without telemetry and repeats a warning on every invocation. Require the config to be non-null here or in both public factory overloads, and add null-config tests for both OTel plugins.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7xeClu","finding_digest":"72e3369ff3c49592e58847eab51615e485e8cede6624a0c8e1097ec6232c1859","finding_id":"arf_v1_olrtnh7tyskzfzmii7vlkfqv4s","finding_key":"otel-plugin/otelpluginenvironment::forglobalprovider::null-config-validation","identity_key":"otel-plugin/otelpluginenvironment::forglobalprovider::null-config-validation","line":59,"observation_digest":"cc1cb505a891da13d82fc59a195cf1d4d3d7a7da463a5764ef861d026ecc2ae3","observation_id":"aro_v1_zqolkbnishnbhwbpywnbsxhr2t","path":"otel-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/otel/OtelPluginEnvironment.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-18T22:34:00Z","review_id":"arr_v1_hhdnbv2okgb6jkqbwd5iuucvet","reviewed_base_sha":"dd19d8efc275c4cf97e34338fff51f53957e42c6","reviewed_head_sha":"43982fe904e91e5fa455a4e260886b18769d819b","reviewer":"codex","start_line":59,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":721},"record_id":"art_v1_fbkiwf5frfyr2xzvuocfrn5w7l","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-18T22:34:00Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
